WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.373
Same face, four lash styles, and four completely different looks!

2
00:00:05.373 --> 00:00:10.233
Classic, Hybrid, Volume or Mega: which one suits you?

3
00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:14.972
Classic: one extension is bonded to each of your natural lashes.

4
00:00:14.972 --> 00:00:19.934
It looks as natural as mascara, perfect for work or your very first set.

5
00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:23.617
Hybrid mixes classic lashes with small volume fans.

6
00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:28.409
The lash line is fuller and has more depth, yet still looks natural.

7
00:00:28.409 --> 00:00:34.072
Volume: each natural lash carries a fan of three to six ultra-fine lashes.

8
00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:39.095
Lashes look full, dark and soft, with no eyeliner needed.

9
00:00:39.095 --> 00:00:44.326
Mega Volume: every fan holds eight to sixteen ultra-fine lashes.

10
00:00:44.326 --> 00:00:50.118
The deep black lash line is truly striking, perfect for parties and photoshoots.

11
00:00:50.118 --> 00:00:59.036
In short: natural, go classic; light fullness, hybrid; full and defined, volume; and for parties, mega.

12
00:00:59.036 --> 00:01:03.202
Not sure which to choose? Ask Moja Beauty, we're happy to help!

13
00:01:03.202 --> 00:01:09.309
Book Moja Beauty in seconds on VaraaAi: pick a service, pick a time, done!
